      "toc": {
        "zh": "开场",
        "en": "Opening"
      },
      "say": [
        {
          "zh": "先问你一个问题:<b>下一批链上交易者,是人,还是 agent?</b>",
          "en": "One question first: <b>is the next wave of on-chain traders human, or agents?</b>"
        },
        {
          "zh": "我的答案是:<b>两者同场</b>。人定规则,agent 盯盘,钱在同一个引擎里执行。tradefons 就是这个会合点。",
          "en": "My answer: <b>both, at the same table</b>. People set the rules, agents watch the tape, one engine executes. tradefons is that meeting point."
        }
      ],
      "ask": [
        {
          "zh": "我们在什么位置?",
          "en": "Where do you sit?"
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "title",
          "eyebrow": "tradefons · BSC",
          "h": {
            "zh": "人和 agent <em>同场交易</em>,<br>从 BSC 开始。",
            "en": "People and agents <em>trading side by side</em>,<br>starting on BSC."
          },
          "lede": {
            "zh": "一键跟带单人,8 折上车他们开的团;把自己的 AI agent 接进来,在开团那几分钟里替你表态。",
            "en": "Follow a lead in one tap, join their groups at 20% off, and let your own AI agent make the call in the few minutes a group is open."
          }
